# Title: Run PowerShell Script from ADS
# ID: 45a594aa-1fbd-4972-a809-ff5a99dd81b8
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Sergey Soldatov, Kaspersky Lab, oscd.community
# Date: 2019-10-30
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1564.004
# Description: Detects PowerShell script execution from Alternate Data Stream (ADS)
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((parent_name:*\\powershell.exe OR parent_name:*\\pwsh.exe) AND (process_name:*\\powershell.exe OR process_name:*\\pwsh.exe) AND (cmdline:*Get-Content* AND cmdline:*-Stream*))
